# LAMMPS input script for Si NPT simulation at 300 K
# This script uses a KIM potential.

# --- Initialization ---
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

# --- KIM Model Initialization ---
# Install model if needed: kim-api-collections-management install user SW_StillingerWeber_1985_Si__MO_405512056662_005
kim init SW_StillingerWeber_1985_Si__MO_405512056662_005 metal
#=== KIM is looking for 'Portable Models' in these directories ===
#  1: .
#  2: /path/to/.kim-api/2.4.0-git+Clang.Clang.GNU.2025-03-25-17-46-17/portable-models-dir
#  3: /path/to/miniconda3/envs/md-studio/lib/openkim-models/portable-models
#=== KIM is looking for 'Simulator Models' in these directories ===
#  1: .
#  2: /path/to/.kim-api/2.4.0-git+Clang.Clang.GNU.2025-03-25-17-46-17/simulator-models-dir
#  3: /path/to/miniconda3/envs/md-studio/lib/openkim-models/simulator-models
#=== BEGIN kim init ==========================================
units metal
neighbor 2.0 bin   # Angstroms
timestep 1.0e-3    # picoseconds

This model has 9 mutable parameters. 
 No.      | Parameter name     | data type  | extent
-----------------------------------------------------
 1        | A                  | "Double"   | 1
 2        | B                  | "Double"   | 1
 3        | p                  | "Double"   | 1
 4        | q                  | "Double"   | 1
 5        | sigma              | "Double"   | 1
 6        | gamma              | "Double"   | 1
 7        | cutoff             | "Double"   | 1
 8        | lambda             | "Double"   | 1
 9        | costheta0          | "Double"   | 1
#=== END kim init ============================================


# --- Atom and Box Definition ---
lattice         diamond 5.43
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.43 5.43 5.43
region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (27.15 27.15 27.15)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 1000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (27.15 27.15 27.15)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

# --- KIM Force Field Definition ---
kim interactions Si
#=== BEGIN kim interactions ==================================
pair_style kim SW_StillingerWeber_1985_Si__MO_405512056662_005
pair_coeff * * Si
#=== END kim interactions ====================================


# --- Settings ---
mass            1 28.0855

# --- Velocity Initialization (CRITICAL for NVT/NPT) ---
velocity        all create 300.0 12345 dist gaussian

# --- Neighbor and Timestep Settings ---
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep        0.001

# --- Ensemble and Output ---
fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 0.0 0.0 1.0
thermo_style    custom step temp press vol pe ke etotal
thermo          100

# --- Run Simulation ---
run             1000

